{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra 2 Contest Problems/Problem 38","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_2_Contest_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/a/08a65f65f319756282b40332c797b3b13f49301a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(t) = t^2 - 4t + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"141\" height=\"21\" />, which of the following describes the average rate of change on the interval <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/6/0764737d3db100cd7543f5c2aad3c8fc6e0df94b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[2, x]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/4/7c4efa1e079a2e23943420d2a78986628344e224.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{f(x)-f(2)}{x-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"98\" height=\"42\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/1/091c8dc2f41b939b72087ad5762befcba0495a06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2x - 4 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ x + 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ x - 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ x^2 - 6 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ x^2 - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"538\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_2_Contest_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/2/98257090e03e3f2b73e27d412ac5c19845ed3a11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = 2^{2} - 4 \\times 2 + 6 = 4 - 8 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"267\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This means that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/5/14589b3594d2067f610b9175bf9036d7f520c3d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{f(x) - f(2)}{x - 2} = \\frac{x^{2} - 4x + 6 - 2}{x - 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"248\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/5/e75c89915d10d9cd2464da3e1160216268bfe1a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{x^{2} - 4x + 4}{x - 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"116\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/0/520ef6dd12d9a1d23092737805be048c64367659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(x - 2)^{2}}{x - 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"69\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/7/067ca12618c4d13c56f31e37137663579f212fb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } x - 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"109\" height=\"30\" /> (for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/4/eb407a9bf8e8af1f7e71129558ea5c4a1acb5cfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" />)\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 37 (page does not exist)\">Problem 37</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 39\">Problem 39</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_Hig